<title>UK: London Clubs bids 181 mln stg for Cap Corp.</title>
<headline>London Clubs bids 181 mln stg for Cap Corp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Clubs International said on Monday it was making a 181 million stg offer for Capital Corporation.</p>
<p>London Clubs said it was offering 47 new shares in its share capital for every 100 Capital Corporation shares, valued under the bid at 181 pence each.</p>
</text>
